<title>SLOVAKIA: Details of Slovak Dec consumer inflation figures.</title>
<headline>Details of Slovak Dec consumer inflation figures.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of Slovak consumer inflation (CPI) for December, as released by the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION	Dec 96   Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		    0.3	0.4	 0.3</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		    5.4	5.4	 7.2</p>
<p>Foodstuffs</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	    0.2	0.2	 0.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year		3.3	3.3	 5.3</p>
<p>Non-food items</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	    0.4	0.5	 0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year		6.5	6.5	 7.9</p>
<p>Public catering</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	    0.4	0.5	 0.3</p>
<p>  pct change year/year		6.0	5.8	 7.4</p>
<p>Services</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	    0.1	0.3	 0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year		5.3	5.3	 8.1</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3688</p>
</text>
